  <Fragment slot="hint">Drag the dial, or click a position. Press the buttons. Keys: <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> dial, <kbd>T</kbd> TEST, <kbd>P</kbd> PI/DAR, <kbd>I</kbd> TIME, <kbd>H</kbd> HOLD, <kbd>B</kbd> backlight.</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="panels">

        <section class="vi-card">
          <h2 class="vi-h"><span>Try a scenario</span></h2>
          <p class="vi-sub">One click sets up the dial, leads and test object. Then press TEST on the instrument.</p>
          <div class="vi-chips" id="scen"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="vi-card">
